# Optional overrides
# VITE_NIMIQ_HUB_URL=https://hub.nimiq.com
# Profile/friends API. Unset: production default in builds, /nimconnect-api
# proxy in dev (NimConnect's write endpoints reject localhost via CORS).
# VITE_NIMCONNECT_API=https://api-nimconnect.nimiqminiapps.com
# VITE_MINIAPPS_API=https://api.nimiqminiapps.com

# apps/api
# Where tips go. Served to the client from /world, so it can be rotated
# without rebuilding the frontend. Falls back to the compiled address.
# TIP_ADDRESS=NQ57 7NBS GKF1 R9B8 CHF1 0P92 67VG 02FF AL5C
# App manifests served from /apps. Defaults to the repo's shared directory,
# packages/app-manifest/src/manifests — set this when deploying the binary
# without the repo layout around it.
# MANIFEST_DIR=/srv/nimworld/manifests
# Browser origin allowed to call the API and open the presence socket.
# ALLOW_ORIGIN=https://nimworld.example
# Set ONLY when a proxy you control rewrites X-Forwarded-For. Otherwise the
# header is attacker-controlled and rate limits key off the socket address.
# TRUST_PROXY_HEADERS=1
